id: pm-github-dependabot-activation
title: Verify live Dependabot merge safety and coordinate fleet activation
description: "Read-only Actions API inspection now reports dependabot-auto-merge.yml active, superseding the earlier disabled snapshot. PR #221 delivers the reusable provenance policy, trusted default-branch caller and independent scheduled audit source. Workflow state alone does not prove safe runtime activation. Keep repository token, event-policy, protected-branch and live-acceptance verification and fleet caller adoption separate from this implementation. Coordinate with companion pm-cli-website-wis6."
