acceptance_criteria: "After reviewed delivery and release, verify each selected caller pins a release containing the policy or uses the reviewed trusted local path.; Verify the active caller has a repository-scoped merge token as Actions and Dependabot secrets when needed, required Actions event policy permits its trusted trigger, and server-enforced protected-branch checks and review requirements prevent unreviewed merges.; With owner authorization record live bot-only arm, foreign-commit revocation and independent scheduled audit acceptance without permitting an unintended merge, and coordinate remaining fleet adoption separately."
