  "2026-11-05T11:10:03.277Z",codex-agent,"Round 2 source delivered and tested without changing live settings: activation snapshot corrected, trusted default-branch caller plus scheduled/manual provenance audit implemented. Focused regression covers this item and passes through the pinned pm runner; restoring the obsolete item fails it. Runtime token, event-policy, branch-protection, live arm/revoke/audit and fleet adoption checks remain blocked pending orchestrator verification. Releasing only my claim; this item remains open."
  "2026-11-14T09:03:31.742Z",codex-sweep-1114,"2026-11-14 sweep: native pm close automatically moved this dependent from blocked to open when pm-github-dependabot-merge closed. https://github.com/unbraind/pm-github/pull/221 merged 2026-11-05T16:59:37Z; merge SHA a7e4d4bb3334f822ff2ecd726a3320f790fc7cb4; PR head 83abb9e2946a5cdfa7263f7d97d41ec172b8f2df. Delivered: Reusable Dependabot provenance policy, trusted caller and independent audit source. Green at that head: test (22), codeql, test (26), bun-release (22), bun-release (26), CodeQL, CodeRabbit, semgrep-cloud-platform/scan. Other check outcomes: cubic · AI code reviewer: NEUTRAL; Sourcery review: SKIPPED (not counted as green). Remaining: verify caller release pins, scoped token availability, trusted event policy and server-enforced branch protection; with owner authorization verify real bot-only arm, foreign-commit revocation and scheduled audits, then coordinate caller adoption. Active workflow state alone is not runtime acceptance; no live settings were changed."
